// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// nanosoc_cov.flist — system-level functional coverage (bind-attached).
// Add to the simulator command line AFTER the design flists:
//   -f $(SOCLABS_PROJECT_DIR)/system/verif/cov/nanosoc_cov.flist
// Needs a simulator with covergroup + bind support (Xcelium, VCS, Questa,
// Verilator >= 5.052). iverilog (socsim default) cannot compile it.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
